      "context_hash": 8241113097596126579,
      "translation": "저장소용 트리아지 대시보드는 <https://triage.rust-lang.org/triage>에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triage": "트리아지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:38.979678Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Any rust-lang repository can be viewed with the form `https://triage.rust-lang.org/triage/<owner>/<repo>`.",
